{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "sample-apis-collection-v1",
    "name": "IBM API Connect — Sample APIs",
    "description": "# IBM API Connect Sample APIs\n\n네 개의 샘플 API 테스트 컬렉션입니다.\n\n## 포함된 API\n- **API 1**: Library Management API (Node.js, 인증 없음, REST)\n- **API 2**: Salary Management API (Python, Keycloak OAuth2 RBAC, REST)\n- **API 3**: Tours Management API (Node.js, 인증 없음, REST)\n- **API 4**: Tours GraphQL API (Node.js, Apollo Server v4, GraphQL)\n\n## 사전 준비\n1. `local-dev/` 에서 `docker compose up --build` 실행\n2. `./init-keycloak.sh` 실행하여 Keycloak 초기화\n\n## 환경 변수 (Postman Environment 설정)\n- `LIBRARY_URL`: http://localhost:3000\n- `SALARY_URL`: http://localhost:8001\n- `KEYCLOAK_URL`: http://localhost:8080\n- `KEYCLOAK_REALM`: corp\n- `TOURS_URL`: http://localhost:3002\n- `GRAPHQL_URL`: http://localhost:4000",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "LIBRARY_URL",   "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "SALARY_URL",    "value": "http://localhost:8001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "KEYCLOAK_URL",  "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "KEYCLOAK_REALM","value": "corp",                  "type": "string" },
    { "key": "alice_token",   "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "carol_token",   "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "hr_token",      "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "TOURS_URL",     "value": "http://localhost:3002",  "type": "string" },
    { "key": "GRAPHQL_URL",   "value": "http://localhost:4000",  "type": "string" },
    { "key": "gql_booking_id","value": "",                       "type": "string" },
    { "key": "gql_customer_email","value": "",                   "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "🔑 Keycloak — 토큰 발급",
      "description": "Keycloak에서 역할별 Access Token을 발급합니다.\n각 요청 실행 후 토큰이 컬렉션 변수에 자동 저장됩니다.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "토큰 발급 — alice (employee)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('alice_token', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('alice token saved');",
                  "    pm.test('Token issued', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id",  "value": "postman-client" },
                { "key": "username",   "value": "alice" },
                { "key": "password",   "value": "alice1234" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{KEYCLOAK_URL}}/realms/{{KEYCLOAK_REALM}}/protocol/openid-connect/token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "토큰 발급 — carol (manager)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('carol_token', pm.response.json().access_token);",
                  "    pm.test('Token issued', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id",  "value": "postman-client" },
                { "key": "username",   "value": "carol" },
                { "key": "password",   "value": "carol1234" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{KEYCLOAK_URL}}/realms/{{KEYCLOAK_REALM}}/protocol/openid-connect/token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "토큰 발급 — hr-system (hr_system)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('hr_token', pm.response.json().access_token);",
                  "    pm.test('Token issued', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id",  "value": "postman-client" },
                { "key": "username",   "value": "hr-system" },
                { "key": "password",   "value": "hrsystem1234" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{KEYCLOAK_URL}}/realms/{{KEYCLOAK_REALM}}/protocol/openid-connect/token"
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "📚 API 1 — Library Management (인증 없음)",
      "description": "Node.js Express CRUD API. 인증 없이 바로 사용 가능합니다.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('status ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "도서 목록 조회",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('has total', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('total'));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/books", "host": ["{{LIBRARY_URL}}"], "path": ["books"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "도서 목록 — 필터(genre=programming)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/books?genre=programming&available=true", "query": [{ "key": "genre", "value": "programming" }, { "key": "available", "value": "true" }] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "도서 등록",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('new_book_id', json.id);",
                  "pm.test('has id', () => pm.expect(json.id).to.be.a('string'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"The Pragmatic Programmer\",\n  \"author\": \"David Thomas\",\n  \"isbn\": \"9780135957059\",\n  \"genre\": \"programming\",\n  \"publishedYear\": 2019,\n  \"stock\": 3\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/books"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "도서 단건 조회",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/books/{{new_book_id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "도서 부분 수정 (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"stock\": 5\n}" },
            "url": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/books/{{new_book_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "대출 신청",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('loan_id', pm.response.json().loan.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"bookId\": \"{{new_book_id}}\",\n  \"borrowerName\": \"Alice\",\n  \"borrowerEmail\": \"alice@test.com\",\n  \"daysToLoan\": 14\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/loans"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "도서 반납",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
          "request": { "method": "PATCH", "url": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/loans/{{loan_id}}/return" }
        },
        {
          "name": "도서 삭제",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{LIBRARY_URL}}/books/{{new_book_id}}" }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "💰 API 2 — Salary Management (Keycloak RBAC)",
      "description": "Python FastAPI + Keycloak OAuth2/OIDC RBAC API.\n\n⚠️ 'Keycloak — 토큰 발급' 폴더를 먼저 실행하세요.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "🟢 공개 엔드포인트",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Health Check",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/health" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Keycloak 설정 확인",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/auth/config" }
            },
            {
              "name": "JWKS 상태 확인",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/auth/jwks-status" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "👤 alice (employee)",
          "description": "alice는 본인 연봉만 조회/수정 가능합니다.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "내 정보 확인 (/auth/me)",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('role is employee', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('employee'));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{alice_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/auth/me"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "본인 연봉 조회 (/salaries/me) ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('is alice', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().employee_id).to.include('alice'));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{alice_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/me"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "전체 조회 → 본인만 반환 (/salaries/) ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('only own record', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().total).to.eql(1));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{alice_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "타인 연봉 조회 → 403 ❌",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{alice_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s002"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "삭제 시도 → 403 ❌",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{alice_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s001"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "👔 carol (manager, engineering)",
          "description": "carol은 engineering 팀 전체 연봉을 조회/수정할 수 있습니다.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "내 정보 확인 (/auth/me)",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('role is manager', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('manager'));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{carol_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/auth/me"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "팀 연봉 목록 조회 (/salaries/) ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('all engineering', () => { pm.response.json().data.forEach(r => pm.expect(r.team).to.eql('engineering')); });"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{carol_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "팀원 연봉 조회 (alice, s001) ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{carol_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s001"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "타팀 연봉 조회 → 403 ❌",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{carol_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s005"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "팀원 연봉 수정 (alice 보너스 인상) ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('updated by manager', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().updated_by_role).to.eql('manager'));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{carol_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"bonus\": 8000000\n}" },
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s001"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "삭제 시도 → 403 ❌",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{carol_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s001"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "🏢 hr-system (hr_system)",
          "description": "hr_system은 전체 연봉 조회/수정/삭제가 가능합니다.\n퇴사 처리 시 DELETE를 사용합니다.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "내 정보 확인 (/auth/me)",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('role is hr_system', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('hr_system'));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{hr_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/auth/me"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "전체 연봉 목록 조회 ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('multiple records', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().total).to.be.above(1));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{hr_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "전체 연봉 수정 (임의 직원) ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{hr_token}}" }, { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"base_salary\": 100000000,\n  \"bonus\": 15000000,\n  \"effective_date\": \"2025-01-01\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s004"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "퇴사 처리 — 연봉 레코드 삭제 (s005) ✅",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200 or 204', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 204]));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{hr_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s005",
                "description": "퇴사 처리 프로세스에서 HR 시스템이 호출합니다.\n이미 삭제된 경우 404를 반환합니다."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "⚠️ 에러 케이스",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "토큰 없음 → 401",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/me" }
            },
            {
              "name": "잘못된 토큰 → 401 or 503",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 401 or 503', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 503]));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer invalid.token.here" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/me"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "존재하지 않는 레코드 → 404",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{hr_token}}" }],
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/salaries/s999"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "🔄 OBO — On-Behalf-Of Token Exchange",
          "description": "서비스 A가 사용자 권한을 대신해서 서비스 B를 호출하는 OBO 패턴입니다.\nRFC 8693 Token Exchange 표준을 따릅니다.\n\n⚠️ Keycloak Token Exchange 기능이 활성화된 환경에서만 /obo/token이 작동합니다.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "OBO 설정 확인 (/obo/info)",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.test('obo enabled', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().obo_enabled).to.be.true);"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{SALARY_URL}}/obo/info",
                "description": "인증 없이 OBO 설정 정보를 확인합니다."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "OBO 토큰 교환 — alice → other-service",
              "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) {", "    const d = pm.response.json();", "    pm.test('has access_token', () => pm.expect(d.access_token).to.be.a('string'));", "    pm.test('original_user is alice', () => pm.expect(d.original_user).to.eql('alice'));", "    pm.collectionVariables.set('obo_token', d.access_token);", "} else {", "    pm.test('OBO setup required (400/503 expected without Keycloak config)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 400, 503]));", "}"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
